Output agro-cli.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 440
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export PATH=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-sandbox-harness/dece6a39-5e13-49c2-b4c5-6ef8107162b8/scratchpad/US-002/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' && cd /home/sandbox/harness && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "agro --version"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "agro harness list"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
